  "origins.neoorigins.wraith.name": "Wraith",
  "origins.neoorigins.wraith.description": "D tarwiḥt yettwaɛettben i yettɛeddin deg tɣawsa tameqqrant. Tettɛedday deg tuget n yiḥedran maca ur tezmir ara ad tɛeddi ɣef ubsidiyan alamma yewweḍ ɣer talɣa-s tameqqrant. Ma teṭṭef yiwet n talɣa tadigant, laẓ ad t-yekkes, tafat n yiṭij ad tesserɣ aksum-is.",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_phase.name": "Talɣa n usfaylu",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_phase.description": "Aḥewwes: tikli deg yisebtaren iǧehden. Mi ara tiliḍ sdaxel n tkerrust, ffeg-d s tlelli (qelleb = d afella, tbeddeḍ = d akessar). Obsidian, crying obsidian, akked bedrock Ḥebseḍ abrid-ik. Asnulfu n usegmi yettak-d laẓ.",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_water_breathing.name": "Ur d-yettneffis ara",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_water_breathing.description": "Ur yeḥwaǧ ara ad yesnuffes. Yezmer ad yidir i lebda ddaw waman.",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_daylight_damage.name": "Taḥulfit i tafat n yiṭij",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_daylight_damage.description": "Tesserɣayeḍ i yiṭij srid.",
